SUMMARY:Graybeard - $5 parking - 9.5 Miles - 2500 ft
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nGreybeard Out-and-Back From Montre
 at\n\nThis is a strenuous hike. Do not sign up if you have not hiked at le
 ast one 7 miler in the past 3 months.\n\nMEETING POINT: CLICK ON THIS LINK
 :\n[https://maps.app.goo.gl/jzWFeJXYb1C1cncP8](https://maps.app.goo.gl/jzW
 FeJXYb1C1cncP8)\nMeetup seems to be picking the wrong trailhead.\n\nAll tr
 ails says there is a $5 parking fee.\n\nleave a note in the comments if yo
 u want to carpool. I suggest meeting at Black Mountain Town Square\, next 
 to the Fire House.\n[https://maps.app.goo.gl/1EcuQMzdSkY6rjpt6 ](https://m
 aps.app.goo.gl/1EcuQMzdSkY6rjpt6?g_st=ac)\n\nDistance: 9.5 Mile\nElevation
  Gain: 250\nRating: Strenuou\nDuration: 6 hours (according to AllTrails\nA
 llTrails Link:[ Rout](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/north-carolina/gr
 aybeard-trail?sh=2kse2w&utm_medium=trail_share&utm_source=alltrails_virali
 ty)\nDogs: On leash\, and only if they have been on a hike with me before.
  No first time dogs\n\nThis is a small group hike. I have not done this ro
 ute before\, but would like to give it a shot on Saturday\n\nRecommended G
 ear: 2 Liters of water\, bug repellant\, snacks/lunc
